<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68361" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dance</i> or <i>rhythmic movement with song</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.606
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more freq.
				<i>song</i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.472
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολπῆς τε γλυκερῆς καὶ ἀμύμονος
					ὀρχηθμοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.637
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολπή τ᾽ ὀρχηστύς τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.152
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				25.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10.84
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6.97
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				106
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.: Com. in lyr., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολπὰ κλαγγά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mnesim.
					4.57
				</span></i>
			 (anap.): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μ. σύριγγος
				ἔχων</span>
			<i>the note</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				212
			</span></i> (lyr.): also in late Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
